        {/* TBD — replace with the jurisdiction of the {site.parent} legal entity. */}
        <em>[TBD — to be completed when the {site.parent} legal entity's
        jurisdiction is confirmed. Common choices: Delaware (US LLC), DIFC
        or ADGM (UAE), Singapore, England &amp; Wales. Pick one, and specify
        the arbitration seat, venue, and language.]</em>
      </p>
      <p>
        These Terms are governed by the laws of <strong>[TBD
        jurisdiction]</strong>, without regard to conflict-of-laws
